NAME
    gcloud compute rollout-plans - read and manipulate Compute Engine Rollout
        Plans

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud compute rollout-plans COMMAND [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    Read and manipulate Compute Engine Rollout Plans.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     create
        Create a Google Compute Engine rollout plan.

     delete
        Delete a Google Compute Engine rollout plan.

     describe
        Describe a rollout plan.

     list
        List Google Compute Engine Rollout Plans.

NOTES
    These variants are also available:

        $ gcloud alpha compute rollout-plans

        $ gcloud beta compute rollout-plans

